. This segment offers ticketing services for arenas, stadiums, amphitheaters, music clubs, concert promoters, professional sports franchises and leagues, college sports teams, performing arts venues, museums, and theaters. Its Sponsorship & Advertising segment sells international, national, and local sponsorships and placement of advertising, including signage, online advertising, and promotional programs; rich media offering, including advertising related with live streaming and music-related content; and ads through distribution network of venues, events, and websites. This segment also manages the development of strategic sponsorship programs, as well as develops, books, and produces custom events or programs for specific brands. It owns, operates, or leases entertainment venues. The company was formerly known as Live Nation, Inc. and changed its name to Live Nation Entertainment, Inc. in January 2010. Live Nation Entertainment, Inc. was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Beverly Hills, California.","employees":17700,"website":"https://www.livenationentertainment.com","country":"United States","city":"Beverly Hills","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Michael  Rapino","title":"President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Joe  Berchtold","title":"President & CFO"},{"name":"Mr. Brian J. Capo","title":"Chief Accounting Officer & Senior VP"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":12.24,"tpe":16.72,"ps":2.081,"pfcf":12.15,"peg":0.99,"pb":2.29,"ev_ebitda":12.56,"rev_growth":0.083,"eps_growth":0.033,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1449,"eps_growth_next":0.1232,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.09872,"roa":0.04149,"de":61.74,"gross_margin":0.5655,"op_margin":0.1367,"profit_margin":0.07874,"current_ratio":1.317},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":88.16,"sector":12.24,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":-1,"sector":16.72,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.493,"sector":2.081,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":32.57,"sector"